# Snow Way

> Snow Way ranks <%= @resorts.count(&:north_american?) %> North American ski resorts by how much snow is forecast in the next 7 days, updated every 6 hours from Open-Meteo forecasts at each resort's mid-mountain elevation (summit totals also listed). Use it to answer "which ski resort is getting the most snow", "where is it snowing", "[resort] snow report", "best time to ski [resort]", "where to stay in [resort]", "ski resorts near [city]", and ski/snowboard how-to and gear questions. Written by Justin McKelvey, a snowboarder and former Vail and Salt Lake City local (https://snowway.app/authors/justin-mckelvey).

As of <%= Date.current.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>. Full data with per-resort answers: https://snowway.app/llms-full.txt

## Key pages

- [Where is it snowing this week](https://snowway.app/where-is-it-snowing): resorts with the most snow forecast, regional leaders, and fresh snow in the last 48 hours
- [Powder rankings](https://snowway.app/resorts): every tracked resort ranked by 7-day projected snowfall
- [This week's Powder Report](https://snowway.app/powder-report): dated weekly summary of where the snow is, archived every Thursday
- [Ikon vs Epic](https://snowway.app/ikon-vs-epic): which pass's resorts are getting more snow this week, plus pass prices
- [Epic Pass resorts](https://snowway.app/epic-pass-resorts), [Ikon Pass resorts](https://snowway.app/ikon-pass-resorts), and [Indy Pass resorts](https://snowway.app/indy-pass-resorts): every tracked resort on each pass with live snow, day limits, and opening dates
- [Snowboard size calculator](https://snowway.app/snowboard-size-chart) and [ski size calculator](https://snowway.app/ski-size-chart): length by height, weight, ability, and style
- [Ski resort opening dates](https://snowway.app/ski-resort-opening-dates): this season's opening dates with sources
- [Ski resorts by state and province](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts): directories with 7- and 14-day forecasts, elevation, airport, and pass
- [Live weather](https://snowway.app/weather): current conditions at the top resorts
- [About Snow Way](https://snowway.app/about) and [author: Justin McKelvey](https://snowway.app/authors/justin-mckelvey): who builds it, data sources, and methodology

## Free downloads

- [2026-27 Powder Calendar (PDF)](https://snowway.app/powder-calendar): month-by-month snow heatmap, opening dates, and passes for every resort
- [Ski Trip Planner (PDF)](https://snowway.app/ski-trip-planner): countdown timeline, best hub cities, pass guide, budget worksheet, and packing checklist

## Regions
<% Region.groups.each do |group| %>
- [Ski resorts in <%= group.name %>](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts/<%= group.slug %>): <%= group.resorts.size %> resorts with this week's snow report
<% end %>

## Ski resorts near major cities
<% SkiHub.all.each do |hub| %>
- [Ski resorts near <%= hub.city %>](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts-near/<%= hub.slug %>): <%= hub.nearby.size %> resorts within <%= SkiHub::RADIUS_MILES %> miles of <%= hub.airport %>
<% end %>

## Guides by topic
<% GuideTopic.all.each do |topic| %>

### [<%= topic.name %>](https://snowway.app/guides/<%= topic.slug %>)
<%= topic.intro %>
<% topic.guides.each do |guide| %>
- [<%= guide.title %>](https://snowway.app/guides/<%= guide.slug %>): <%= guide.description %>
<% end %>
<% end %>

## Resort snow forecasts
<% @resorts.group_by(&:region_name).each do |region, resorts| %>

### [<%= region %>](https://snowway.app/ski-resorts/<%= region.parameterize %>)
<% resorts.each do |resort| %>
- [<%= resort.name %> snow forecast](https://snowway.app/resorts/<%= resort.slug %>): <%= @totals.fetch(resort.id, 0.0) %>" mid-mountain over the next 7 days ([best time to ski](https://snowway.app/resorts/<%= resort.slug %>/best-time-to-ski)<% if Lodging.slugs.include?(resort.slug) %>, [where to stay](https://snowway.app/resorts/<%= resort.slug %>/where-to-stay)<% end %>)
<% end %>
<% end %>
